    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Notes & metric names",
      "gridPos": { "h": 3, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "id": 1,
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "Traefik traffic dashboard.\n\n**Metric name version check** - run on a Traefik host:\n\n```\ncurl -s localhost:9102/metrics | grep -E 'traefik_(router|service|entrypoint).*(bucket|seconds)' | head\n```\n\n- Traefik **v2.x**: `traefik_*_request_duration_seconds_bucket`  \n- Traefik **v3.x**: `traefik_*_request_seconds_bucket` (adjust panel expr names below if needed)\n\nMachine attribution uses the vmagent scrape label `instance` (`traefik-m1` / `traefik-m3` in the multi-machine setup)."
      },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": {}, "overrides": [] }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Requests per second",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 8, "x": 0, "y": 3 },
      "id": 2,
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "victoriametrics" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": { "unit": "reqps", "min": 0, "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "fillOpacity": 10, "lineWidth": 1, "showPoints": "never", "stacking": { "mode": "none" } } },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom", "showLegend": true },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      },
      "targets": [
        { "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "victoriametrics" }, "expr": "sum(rate(traefik_router_requests_total[$__rate_interval]))", "legendFormat": "all routers", "refId": "A" }
      ]
    },
